    "body": "@MattMenke2 ah, I suspect the mapping from 32- to 16-bit happens at the IDL layer (`status` is `unsigned short` which is 16-bit). (And yeah, I didn't delve into 206, 3xx, and such here as we already have issues or they are already adequately tested. If I remember correctly 3xx without `Location` or assigned meaning are passed to the caller.)",
