    "updated_at": "2024-06-02T14:41:26Z",
    "body": "The spec says `A <dfn export>redirect status</dfn> is a <a for=/>status</a> that is 301, 302, 303, 307, or 308.` – should it also mention that real world browsers do honor `Location` header for a redirect with any status code?",
